{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0288",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "他稍作歇息，深深地吸一口气，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He rested for a moment and took a deep breath,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他觉得自己应该爬得很高了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "thinking he must have climbed quite high by now,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "可他微微睁开眼睛，大吃一惊：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but when he opened his eyes a little, he was stunned:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "连五米都还没到。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he had not even reached five meters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "究竟一直在干什么呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What on earth had he been doing all this time?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "而且，那坡度也比从底下往上看时，陡了近两倍。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Besides, the slope was nearly twice as steep as it had looked from below.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "从那儿往上看的情景更吓人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The view upward from there was even more frightening.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "他打算攀登上去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He meant to climb his way up,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "可怎么老像在做着陷进去的努力。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but somehow it always felt as if he were only struggling to sink in deeper.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00288",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "头顶上，沙檐挡住了去路。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Overhead, an overhang of sand blocked the way.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
